{"seq":1,"slug":"pinia-fundamentals","title":"Pinia 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/state-management/pinia-fundamentals","wordCount":560,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"pinia-基础\">Pinia 基础</h1><h2 id=\"vue-官方状态管理\">Vue 官方状态管理</h2><p>Pinia 是 Vue 的官方状态管理库，取代了 Vuex 成为 Vue 3 的推荐方案。它提供了更简洁的 API、完整的 TypeScript 支持和更好的开发体验。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Vuex[&quot;Vuex(旧方案)&quot;]&#10;        VS[&quot;State&quot;] --&gt; VG[&quot;Getters&quot;]&#10;        VM[&quot;Mutations(同步)&quot;] --&gt; VS&#10;        VA[&quot;Actions(异步)&quot;] --&gt; VM&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Pinia[&quot;Pinia(新方案)&quot;]&#10;        PS[&quot;State&quot;] --&gt; PG[&quot;Getters&quot;]&#10;        PA[&quot;Actions(同步/异步)&quot;] --&gt; PS&#10;    end&#10;    Vuex -.-&gt;|演进| Pinia\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Vuex[\"Vuex(旧方案)\"]\n        VS[\"State\"] --&gt; VG[\"Getters\"]\n        VM[\"Mutations(同步)\"] --&gt; VS\n        VA[\"Actions(异步)\"] --&gt; VM\n    end\n    subgraph Pinia[\"Pinia(新方案)\"]\n        PS[\"State\"] --&gt; PG[\"Getters\"]\n        PA[\"Actions(同步/异步)\"] --&gt; PS\n    end\n    Vuex -.-&gt;|演进| Pinia</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比</th>\n<th>Vuex 4</th>\n<th>Pinia</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Mutations</td>\n<td>必须</td>\n<td>无（直接修改 state）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td>需要额外配置</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模块嵌套</td>\n<td>嵌套模块 + namespaced</td>\n<td>扁平化 store</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码分割</td>\n<td>手动配置</td>\n<td>自动按需导入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DevTools</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包体积</td>\n<td>~2KB</td>\n<td>~1.5KB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Store</strong>：集中存放、被多个组件共享的响应式状态容器，天然是全局单例。</li>\n<li><strong>state / getters / actions</strong>：分别对应状态、派生值与变更逻辑；Pinia 取消了 Vuex 的 Mutations，同步与异步统一在 actions 中。</li>\n<li><strong>Setup Store</strong>：用 Composition API 风格定义的 store，灵活性与 TypeScript 推断优于 Option Store。</li>\n<li><strong>响应性解构</strong>：直接解构 store 会丢失响应性，须用 <code>storeToRefs</code> 取 state/getters，actions 可直接解构。</li>\n<li><strong>DevTools 集成</strong>：Pinia 接入 Vue DevTools，提供状态查看、编辑、actions 追踪与时间旅行。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"definestore\">defineStore</h2><h3 id=\"option-store\">Option Store</h3><p>类似 Vue Options API 的风格：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// stores/counter.ts&#10;import { defineStore } from &#39;pinia&#39;;&#10;&#10;export const useCounterStore = defineStore(&#39;counter&#39;, {&#10;  state: () =&gt; ({&#10;    count: 0,&#10;    name: &#39;Vue&#39;,&#10;    items: [] as string[],&#10;  }),&#10;&#10;  getters: {&#10;    doubleCount: (state): number =&gt; state.count * 2,&#10;    itemCount(): number {&#10;      return this.items.length;&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;&#10;  actions: {&#10;    increment() {&#10;      this.count++;&#10;    },&#10;    async fetchItems() {&#10;      const res = await fetch(&#39;/api/items&#39;);&#10;      this.items = await res.json();&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// stores/counter.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineStore } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pinia'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> useCounterStore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'counter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    items: [] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  getters: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    doubleCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state.count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    itemCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.items.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actions: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchItems</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> res</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/items'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.items </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"setup-store-推荐\">Setup Store（推荐）</h3><p>使用 Composition API 风格，更灵活：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// stores/counter.ts&#10;import { defineStore } from &#39;pinia&#39;;&#10;import { ref, computed } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;export const useCounterStore = defineStore(&#39;counter&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  const count = ref&lt;number&gt;(0);&#10;  const name = ref&lt;string&gt;(&#39;Vue&#39;);&#10;  const items = ref&lt;string[]&gt;([]);&#10;&#10;  const doubleCount = computed&lt;number&gt;(() =&gt; count.value * 2);&#10;  const itemCount = computed&lt;number&gt;(() =&gt; items.value.length);&#10;&#10;  function increment() {&#10;    count.value++;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async function fetchItems() {&#10;    const res = await fetch(&#39;/api/items&#39;);&#10;    items.value = await res.json();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return { count, name, items, doubleCount, itemCount, increment, fetchItems };&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// stores/counter.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineStore } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pinia'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ref, computed } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> useCounterStore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'counter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>([]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> doubleCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> itemCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items.value.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    count.value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchItems</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> res</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/items'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    items.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { count, name, items, doubleCount, itemCount, increment, fetchItems };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比</th>\n<th>Option Store</th>\n<th>Setup Store</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语法风格</td>\n<td>Options API</td>\n<td>Composition API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>结构固定</td>\n<td>完全自由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Composable 复用</td>\n<td>受限</td>\n<td>可直接使用 composable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>更好（完整推断）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习成本</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>需要了解 Composition API</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"在组件中使用\">在组件中使用</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { useCounterStore } from &#39;@/stores/counter&#39;;&#10;import { storeToRefs } from &#39;pinia&#39;;&#10;&#10;const counterStore = useCounterStore();&#10;&#10;// 直接解构会丢失响应性&#10;// ❌ const { count, doubleCount } = counterStore&#10;&#10;// ✅ 使用 storeToRefs 保持响应性（只解构 state 和 getters）&#10;const { count, doubleCount, items } = storeToRefs(counterStore);&#10;// Actions 可以直接解构&#10;const { increment, fetchItems } = counterStore;&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;div&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;计数：{{ count }}，双倍：{{ doubleCount }}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;    &lt;button @click=&quot;increment&quot;&gt;+1&lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;button @click=&quot;fetchItems&quot;&gt;加载数据&lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;ul&gt;&#10;      &lt;li v-for=&quot;item in items&quot; :key=&quot;item&quot;&gt;{{ item }}&lt;/li&gt;&#10;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { useCounterStore } from '@/stores/counter';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { storeToRefs } from 'pinia';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const counterStore = useCounterStore();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 直接解构会丢失响应性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ const { count, doubleCount } = counterStore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 使用 storeToRefs 保持响应性（只解构 state 和 getters）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const { count, doubleCount, items } = storeToRefs(counterStore);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Actions 可以直接解构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const { increment, fetchItems } = counterStore;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;p>计数：{{ count }}，双倍：{{ doubleCount }}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;button @click=\"increment\">+1&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;button @click=\"fetchItems\">加载数据&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;li v-for=\"item in items\" :key=\"item\">{{ item }}&#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"state-操作\">State 操作</h2><h3 id=\"直接修改\">直接修改</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const store = useCounterStore();&#10;store.count++;&#10;store.name = &#39;Pinia&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> store</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useCounterStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">store.count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">store.name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Pinia'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"patch-批量修改\">$patch 批量修改</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 对象形式&#10;store.$patch({&#10;  count: store.count + 1,&#10;  name: &#39;Pinia&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 函数形式（推荐，适合复杂修改）&#10;store.$patch((state) =&gt; {&#10;  state.count++;&#10;  state.items.push(&#39;new item&#39;);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 对象形式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">store.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$patch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  count: store.count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Pinia'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 函数形式（推荐，适合复杂修改）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">store.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$patch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  state.count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  state.items.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'new item'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"reset-重置状态\">$reset 重置状态</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 仅 Option Store 支持&#10;store.$reset();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 仅 Option Store 支持</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">store.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$reset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Setup Store 不支持 <code>$reset</code>，需要手动实现重置逻辑。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"devtools-集成\">DevTools 集成</h2><p>Pinia 与 Vue DevTools 深度集成，提供以下功能：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    DT[&quot;Vue DevTools&quot;]&#10;    DT --&gt; S[&quot;查看 State&quot;]&#10;    DT --&gt; T[&quot;时间旅行&quot;]&#10;    DT --&gt; E[&quot;编辑 State&quot;]&#10;    DT --&gt; A[&quot;Actions 追踪&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    DT[\"Vue DevTools\"]\n    DT --&gt; S[\"查看 State\"]\n    DT --&gt; T[\"时间旅行\"]\n    DT --&gt; E[\"编辑 State\"]\n    DT --&gt; A[\"Actions 追踪\"]</pre><p>在浏览器中安装 Vue DevTools 后，可以：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>实时查看所有 store 的状态</li>\n<li>追踪 actions 的调用和参数</li>\n<li>手动编辑 state 值进行调试</li>\n<li>使用时间旅行回退状态变化</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Pinia 是 Vue 3 官方状态管理库，替代 Vuex，API 更简洁</li>\n<li>移除了 Mutations 概念，Actions 统一处理同步和异步逻辑</li>\n<li><strong>Setup Store</strong> 使用 Composition API 风格，灵活性更高，TypeScript 推断更好</li>\n<li>使用 <code>storeToRefs</code> 解构 state/getters 保持响应性，actions 可直接解构</li>\n<li><code>$patch</code> 支持批量更新状态，函数形式适合复杂修改</li>\n<li>Vue DevTools 提供完整的状态检查、编辑和时间旅行调试能力</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Pinia 基础","id":"pinia-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"Vue 官方状态管理","id":"vue-官方状态管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"defineStore","id":"definestore"},{"level":3,"text":"Option Store","id":"option-store"},{"level":3,"text":"Setup Store（推荐）","id":"setup-store-推荐"},{"level":2,"text":"在组件中使用","id":"在组件中使用"},{"level":2,"text":"State 操作","id":"state-操作"},{"level":3,"text":"直接修改","id":"直接修改"},{"level":3,"text":"$patch 批量修改","id":"patch-批量修改"},{"level":3,"text":"$reset 重置状态","id":"reset-重置状态"},{"level":2,"text":"DevTools 集成","id":"devtools-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Teleport 与 Suspense","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/component-design/teleport-and-suspense"},"next":{"title":"Pinia 进阶模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/state-management/pinia-advanced-patterns"}}